the reviews collection is a set of small  tables of different heights and  different shapes they create a very  organic composition of landscapes in the  living space  and they evoke a very imaginative  atmosphere with its compositions  we did not set out to design a set of  tables instead day to day we always  doodling sketching when you're working  on projects so we find ourselves doing a  lot of small sketches which are like a  lot of soft organic shapes so when these  shapes overlap one another it forms a  very nice composition  so we thought to relate it back to like  a product a table seems to be quite a  suitable category to design  we begin to laser cut out small models  and putting legs on them and start to  compose them together so once we put  them together it feels like it needs to  be a family of tables  and the challenge was to really look at  all the sketches and all the models  there are hundreds of them and how do we  actually choose tables to form a family  i think the award gathers the best works  so such that it gives a lot of reference  to designers about the the quality and  the bar that the award has set  and i think that'll improve the quality  on design in general in singapore  my advice would be to try everything and  to embrace everything and know that  serendipity sometimes does amazing  things for us as designers  this is rabbit and the tortoise  collection  design of the year  you
 

